<h3 data-section-id=3D"1iifir2" data-start=3D"1273" data-end=3D"1289">1) ST=
M32 MCU</h3>
<p data-start=3D"1290" data-end=3D"1333">Use the STM32 as the <strong data-=
start=3D"1311" data-end=3D"1332">system controller</strong>.</p>
<p data-start=3D"1335" data-end=3D"1352">It should handle:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"1354" data-end=3D"1638">
<li data-section-id=3D"461dg6" data-start=3D"1354" data-end=3D"1381">
<p data-start=3D"1356" data-end=3D"1381">startup and configuration</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"13t7vqs" data-start=3D"1382" data-end=3D"1421">
<p data-start=3D"1384" data-end=3D"1421">control of the reader IC over <str=
ong data-start=3D"1414" data-end=3D"1421">SPI</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"e6q5ck" data-start=3D"1422" data-end=3D"1466">
<p data-start=3D"1424" data-end=3D"1466">inventory sequencing and applicati=
on rules</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"88114r" data-start=3D"1467" data-end=3D"1488">
<p data-start=3D"1469" data-end=3D"1488">filtering tag reads</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"nwswsf" data-start=3D"1489" data-end=3D"1546">
<p data-start=3D"1491" data-end=3D"1546">host interfaces such as <strong da=
ta-start=3D"1515" data-end=3D"1546">Ethernet, UART, RS-485, USB</strong></p=
>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"17z0gb2" data-start=3D"1547" data-end=3D"1638">
<p data-start=3D"1549" data-end=3D"1638">GPIO control for RF switches, PA e=
nable, buzzer, LEDs, relays, and access-control outputs</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"1640" data-end=3D"1839">ST=E2=80=99s own UHF evaluation bo=
ards use an <strong data-start=3D"1678" data-end=3D"1709">STM32L476RG / STM=
32L476RGT6</strong> as the controller around the <strong data-start=3D"1739=
" data-end=3D"1753">ST25RU3993</strong>, which is a strong real-world refer=
