<h2 data-section-id=3D"1dd5o9j" data-start=3D"17592" data-end=3D"17618">Wha=
t this header is for</h2>
<p data-start=3D"17620" data-end=3D"17640">This file gives you:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"17642" data-end=3D"17784">
<li data-section-id=3D"vtv7y9" data-start=3D"17642" data-end=3D"17662">
<p data-start=3D"17644" data-end=3D"17662">register addresses</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"j31rzj" data-start=3D"17663" data-end=3D"17689">
<p data-start=3D"17665" data-end=3D"17689">direct command constants</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"4sb4nu" data-start=3D"17690" data-end=3D"17705">
<p data-start=3D"17692" data-end=3D"17705">IRQ bit masks</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1jl9s63" data-start=3D"17706" data-end=3D"17720">
<p data-start=3D"17708" data-end=3D"17720">FIFO helpers</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"10zkoma" data-start=3D"17721" data-end=3D"17742">
<p data-start=3D"17723" data-end=3D"17742">protocol mode flags</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"txskyh" data-start=3D"17743" data-end=3D"17784">
<p data-start=3D"17745" data-end=3D"17784">readable macros for early firmwa=
re work</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"17786" data-end=3D"17822">That sets up the next layer clea=
nly.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"1b98k1x" data-start=3D"17824" data-end=3D"17848">Wha=
t should come next</h2>
<p data-start=3D"17850" data-end=3D"17873">The right next file is:</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"dmo9v1" data-start=3D"17875" data-end=3D"17900"><spa=
n role=3D"text"><code data-start=3D"17879" data-end=3D"17900">st25ru3993_dr=
iver.c</code></span></h3>
<p data-start=3D"17902" data-end=3D"17922">It should implement:</p>
<ul data-start=3D"17923" data-end=3D"18096">
<li data-section-id=3D"m666le" data-start=3D"17923" data-end=3D"17938">
<p data-start=3D"17925" data-end=3D"17938">chip bring-up</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"s79r3w" data-start=3D"17939" data-end=3D"17950">
<p data-start=3D"17941" data-end=3D"17950">soft init</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1x6x940" data-start=3D"17951" data-end=3D"17965">
<p data-start=3D"17953" data-end=3D"17965">version read</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1vr0tvg" data-start=3D"17966" data-end=3D"17983">
<p data-start=3D"17968" data-end=3D"17983">IRQ mask config</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"1f37wg0" data-start=3D"17984" data-end=3D"18002">
<p data-start=3D"17986" data-end=3D"18002">FIFO length read</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"al5w76" data-start=3D"18003" data-end=3D"18058">
<p data-start=3D"18005" data-end=3D"18058">protocol switch between <strong =
data-start=3D"18029" data-end=3D"18035">6C</strong> and <strong data-start=
=3D"18040" data-end=3D"18058">6B direct mode</strong></p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"qiccxr" data-start=3D"18059" data-end=3D"18075">
<p data-start=3D"18061" data-end=3D"18075">antenna select</p>
</li>
<li data-section-id=3D"dqleth" data-start=3D"18076" data-end=3D"18096">
<p data-start=3D"18078" data-end=3D"18096">RX/TX option setup</p>
</li>
</ul>
<p data-start=3D"18098" data-end=3D"18114">Then after that:</p>
<h3 data-section-id=3D"1pe01j4" data-start=3D"18116" data-end=3D"18138"><sp=
an role=3D"text"><code data-start=3D"18120" data-end=3D"18138">gen2_invento=
ry.c</code></span></h3>
<p data-start=3D"18140" data-end=3D"18204">That will start the actual <stro=
ng data-start=3D"18167" data-end=3D"18203">ISO/IEC 18000-6C inventory logic=
</strong>.</p>
<h2 data-section-id=3D"qyt8lm" data-start=3D"18206" data-end=3D"18219">Smal=
l note</h2>
<p data-start=3D"18221" data-end=3D"18622">This header is a <strong data-st=
art=3D"18238" data-end=3D"18272">practical firmware abstraction</strong>, n=
ot a full datasheet mirror. Before production bring-up, you should verify e=
ach register bit against the exact <strong data-start=3D"18385" data-end=3D=
"18418">ST25RU3993 datasheet revision</strong> and, if you use it, ST=E2=80=
=99s SDK documentation. The ST25RU3993 datasheet documents the SPI access m=
odes and chip capabilities, and ST=E2=80=99s SDK is intended for STM32-base=
d embedded development around this part.</p>
<p data-start=3D"18624" data-end=3D"18685" data-is-last-node=3D"" data-is-o=
nly-node=3D"">Send <strong data-start=3D"18629" data-end=3D"18644">=E2=80=
